OL,3,GNEWSARacing car worth #350k stolen from
OL,4,Aexhibition venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British Touring Car Championship
OL,7,F(BTCC) team is offering a #25,000
OL,8,Freward after one of its racing cars was
OL,9,Fstolen from an exhibition centre.
OL,11,FPower Maxed Racing, based in Studley,
OL,12,FWarwickshire, said its Dexter Patterson
OL,13,FBTCC Audi, worth about #350,000, was
OL,14,Ftaken from a compound at Excel London
OL,15,Fon Wednesday night.
OL,17,FIt comes 15 months after the team had
OL,18,Fto rebuild from scratch following a
OL,19,Ffire that destroyed its vehicles and
OL,20,Fformer headquarters in Bretforton, near
OL,21,FEvesham.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
