OL,3,GNEWSARacing car worth #350k stolen from
OL,4,Aexhibition venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has contacted Excel London for
OL,7,Fa statement. The Metropolitan Police
OL,8,Fsaid it did not comment on individual
OL,9,Fincidents of car crime.
